title: Win
position: -125,110
---
<<stopmusic FMODSoundManager>>
<<notmove Cat>>
Clark: ...Ok, that was a lucky guess.
Steve: So... that's it?
Clark: We did it! The experiment is complete.
Steve: Yeah! Oh man, Schrödinger would be so proud.
<<wait  1>>
Steve: Wait. What was the experiment again?
Clark: ...
Steve: That's... wait a minute, so... what did we find exactly?
Steve: How did the maze contribute again? Why did we even root for the cat to die? Actually, why cats to begin with?
Clark: Because they're... cute?
<<wait  1>>
Clark: Steve... I think we screwed up. I think we got lost along the way. Mostly between the maze and the death traps.
Steve: Soooo... should I get the gas tank or...?
Clark: I'll call my dad's insurance company.
<<if $deathOnce>>
<<else>>
    Clark: I may take the cat with me though. Lucky paws!
<<endif>>
<<winskill Canvas>>
<<move Cat>>
===

