Clark: Don't you remember that the <color=yellow>antidote</color> had different effects depending on the exposure to the <color=green>poison</color>?
Steve: Yes?
Clark: It is only good if the <color=green>poison</color> has full effect. Remeber when you tried to eat it and I told you NO because you were <color=green>not poisoned enough</color> and I said that it would <color=red>kill</color> you?
